@startuml
title SysMon - User Deletion Activity Diagram

|Admin (Tier 1)|
start
:Open Users panel;
:Select Manage Access;
:Select existing user;
:Select Delete User;

|SysMon Frontend|
:Display deletion confirmation panel;

|Admin (Tier 1)|
if (Confirm deletion?) then (Yes)
  :Enter admin password;
  :Select Confirm;

  |SysMon Authentication System|
  :Verify administrator password;

  if (Password correct?) then (Yes)
    :Delete selected user account;
    |SysMon Frontend|
    :Display deletion success;
  else (No)
    :Reject deletion request;
    :Display authentication error;
  endif

else (No)
  :Cancel deletion;
  :Leave user account unchanged;
endif

stop
@enduml
